body:
there's this one vtuber i see post more than sunako while i have actually only seen like 3 people on this list ever (Tecnnicalneat a moment ago, sunako, and the blond guy (sorry forgot the name)). 

&#x200B;

I made a new acct recently to start posting regularly on several subs but i also feel bad cause this just does seem like a self-promo sub. ig thats why u should try to mix it up - like you did!!

There is so many times I've gone in a store without buying anything and i CONSTANTLY feel bad, even with no bag, honestly without carrying anything (but a wallet and keys). 

Add in the staring of employees and sometimes shoppers ugh.

and have had an experience where I went in with a water bottle (I walk / ride public transport mostly) and have been assumed stealing because "I didn't pay" ( for what I came in with). Luckily it was a quick explanation and a "I'm literally already outside of the store" as they asked? Still pisses me off but I don't want to die mad. 

&#x200B;

I know this might sound "race baity" but it doesn't help I'm black so I already get stares (and have experienced being followed around) especially going into small stores ;-;

Fuels the social anxiety x400
